      "text": "Data access: \n- > write comments: \n-> not updating data , writing appending.\n-> write heavy\n-> cassandra\n-> partition with streamId.-> primary\n-> insert those comments: \n-> lsm sst -> optimised for write instead of using btree db -> sql",
